592 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 312 0 R
/E (Our solution improves the network security auditing process by making it faster, simpler, and more reliable. Instead of manually checking thousands of configuration lines across different vendors, the AI-driven auditor automatically identifies security gaps, assesses their severity, and provides actionable remediation steps. This helps organizations improve their security posture while reducing the time and effort needed for regular compliance audits. The system is also designed to scale as the network grows and as new vendors or configuration types are added.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
593 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 312 0 R
/T (The main beneficiaries are government security teams, network administrators, security auditors, and IT infrastructure teams. In heterogeneous networks, teams often deal with different vendors, different configuration syntaxes, manual checklists, slow analysis, and scattered findings. Our solution brings these configurations into a single AI-assisted platform, converts them into a common security model, performs automated compliance checks, and presents the results in one centralized view. This shifts the process from simply finding a problem to clearly showing what failed, why it matters, and how it can be fixed.)
/E (The main beneficiaries are government security teams, network administrators, security auditors, and IT infrastructure teams. In heterogeneous networks, teams often deal with different vendors, different configuration syntaxes, manual checklists, slow analysis, and scattered findings. Our solution brings these configurations into a single AI-assisted platform, converts them into a common security model, performs automated compliance checks, and presents the results in one centralized view. This shifts the process from simply finding a problem to clearly showing what failed, why it matters, and how it can be fixed.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
594 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 312 0 R
/T (The solution also provides social, economic, and environmental benefits. Socially, it supports better security and stronger compliance across critical network infrastructure. Economically, it reduces manual auditing effort and the need for multiple vendor-specific tools by providing one common platform. From an environmental perspective, digital configuration analysis and reporting reduce paper-based documentation and unnecessary physical audit activities. Overall, our goal is to make network auditing simpler, more consistent, and easier to manage as the network grows.)
/E (The solution also provides social, economic, and environmental benefits. Socially, it supports better security and stronger compliance across critical network infrastructure. Economically, it reduces manual auditing effort and the need for multiple vendor-specific tools by providing one common platform. From an environmental perspective, digital configuration analysis and reporting reduce paper-based documentation and unnecessary physical audit activities. Overall, our goal is to make network auditing simpler, more consistent, and easier to manage as the network grows.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
