1486 0 obj
<<
/Title (The main beneficiaries are government security teams, network administrators, security auditors, and IT infrastructure teams. In heterogeneous networks, teams often deal with different vendors, different configuration syntaxes, manual checklists, slow analysis, and scattered findings. Our solution brings these configurations into a single AI-assisted platform, converts them into a common security model, performs automated compliance checks, and presents the results in one centralized view. This shifts the process from simply finding a problem to clearly showing what failed, why it matters, and how it can be fixed.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1381 0 R
/Next 1583 0 R
>>
