/Title (The solution also provides social, economic, and environmental benefits. Socially, it supports better security and stronger compliance across critical network infrastructure. Economically, it reduces manual auditing effort and the need for multiple vendor-specific tools by providing one common platform. From an environmental perspective, digital configuration analysis and reporting reduce paper-based documentation and unnecessary physical audit activities. Overall, our goal is to make network auditing simpler, more consistent, and easier to manage as the network grows.)
